      "created_at": "2015-03-16T23:05:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Some events that have been run on the forums, where the results of the previous round determine which scenario is next and the specifics of that scenario. Not only is win/loss is important, but so is the final hp of each character, and even scenario specific goals. Like how many Mega Computers were in play at the end, were you able to beat someone without destroying X, things like that.</p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/living-sentinels-campaign-campaign-thread-3768\">#1</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/living-sentinels-campaign-2-campaign-thread-do-not-post-in-this-thread-4360\">#2</a></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/living-sentinels-campaign-thread-3-do-not-post-in-this-thread-4921\">#3</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
